# Summary

The charter includes a section for the membership fee. [[cite:obs-de5bbb489a6e5dd62c93b63c622d86c99a9f956f "## Membership fee"]]

Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-de5bbb489a6e5dd62c93b63c622d86c99a9f956f "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]